  Result: Fixed the bug in `_split_context_for_compression` by repeatedly adjusting the boundary to avoid splitting multi-tool call/result pairs. This ensures the compression context and reserved context do not contain unmatched tool calls or results, preventing invalid requests to the provider.

I added a new dedicated async test to reproduce the user's case and verify no such splitting occurs. The test passed successfully.

